WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.945 --> 00:00:13.647
Wukong soared through the air on a cloud.

2
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:17.348
"I'll help this kingdom for a little while," he said.

3
00:00:17.368 --> 00:00:20.509
"Then I'll locate Bajie and return to Master."

4
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:26.571
When Wukong arrived at True Savings Bank, he saw several people in blue uniforms.

5
00:00:27.311 --> 00:00:28.812
He also spotted Detective Smith.

6
00:00:32.104 --> 00:00:35.186
"Hello, again, Detective," Wukong said, landing next to him.

7
00:00:35.907 --> 00:00:36.607
"I'm here to help.

8
00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:39.569
Who's robbing True Savings Bank—demons?"

9
00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.831
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

10
00:00:41.851 --> 00:00:43.973
"Very funny, Wukong.

11
00:00:44.273 --> 00:00:46.234
The robbers aren't demons."

12
00:00:47.475 --> 00:00:48.376
Wukong frowned.

13
00:00:48.396 --> 00:00:50.978
"I wasn't making a joke, but okay."

14
00:00:52.078 --> 00:00:53.459
He pulled out his iron bar.

15
00:00:53.479 --> 00:00:56.281
"I'll go inside and smash the robbers."

16
00:00:57.222 --> 00:00:58.303
Detective Smith gasped.

17
00:00:58.323 --> 00:00:59.684
"What did you say?"

18
00:01:00.572 --> 00:01:05.256
"I'm going to smash the robbers," Wukong said, swinging his iron bar.

19
00:01:05.276 --> 00:01:10.100
"I'll completely flatten them, and they'll never cause trouble again."

20
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:13.683
"No, Wukong!"

21
00:01:14.003 --> 00:01:15.965
Detective Smith said, holding up his hands.

22
00:01:15.985 --> 00:01:20.468
"We just need to arrest the robbers—it's wrong to hurt people."

23
00:01:20.488 --> 00:01:24.712
"You're right," Wukong said with a sigh.

24
00:01:24.732 --> 00:01:29.536
"Everyone is always telling me the same thing—it's not okay to hurt anyone.

25
00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.901
Don't worry, Detective, I promise to be good."

26
00:01:35.582 --> 00:01:38.183
Wukong put away his iron bar and went inside the bank.

27
00:01:39.944 --> 00:01:42.945
Two men were stuffing stacks of small green paper into bags.

28
00:01:43.706 --> 00:01:45.386
One man saw Wukong and laughed.

29
00:01:46.047 --> 00:01:48.167
"Check out the monkey, Earl!"

30
00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:49.548
Earl laughed.

31
00:01:49.568 --> 00:01:52.149
"I see him, Dwight!

32
00:01:52.609 --> 00:01:54.250
He's one funny-looking monkey!"

33
00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.151
"Where did he come from?"

34
00:01:56.451 --> 00:01:57.131
Dwight asked.

35
00:01:57.911 --> 00:01:59.232
Wukong tapped his chin.

36
00:01:59.908 --> 00:02:03.230
"I originally came from a rock, on the Fruit and Flower Mountain."

37
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.672
"The monkey talked!"

38
00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.333
Earl said.

39
00:02:06.353 --> 00:02:09.915
"Yes, I can talk," Wukong said with a laugh.

40
00:02:09.935 --> 00:02:15.759
"And I'm here to inform you that you're both under arrest."

41
00:02:16.499 --> 00:02:20.422
For a moment Dwight and Earl were silent, and then they burst out laughing.

42
00:02:23.804 --> 00:02:27.047
Wukong pretended to laugh for a second before growing tall.

43
00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:28.788
His eyes turned red.

44
00:02:31.188 --> 00:02:34.089
"Ahh!" The men screamed and ran out of the bank.

45
00:02:39.552 --> 00:02:40.632
a police officer shouted.

46
00:02:41.152 --> 00:02:44.454
Dwight and Earl ignored the police as they dived into a car and took off.

47
00:02:46.755 --> 00:02:50.716
Smash! Wukong leaped through the bank's window and landed in the street.

48
00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:53.297
He saw the robbers' car disappear around the corner.

49
00:02:53.978 --> 00:02:55.078
Wukong had an idea.

50
00:02:55.918 --> 00:02:59.580
He quickly muttered a spell, and light sparkled before he changed form.

51
00:03:00.256 --> 00:03:01.876
He had transformed into a car!

52
00:03:03.297 --> 00:03:06.758
Vroom! Wukong's tires spun and smoke filled the air.

53
00:03:07.238 --> 00:03:09.279
He shot forward, zooming down the street.

54
00:03:09.299 --> 00:03:11.399
Wukong chuckled with delight.

55
00:03:11.419 --> 00:03:13.580
"This is fun!"

56
00:03:19.101 --> 00:03:21.822
juggler is very talented," Roxy said.

57
00:03:22.942 --> 00:03:25.403
She and the squire were eating a meal inside a beautiful room.

58
00:03:26.023 --> 00:03:29.144
A man juggled balls while several musicians played instruments.

59
00:03:30.452 --> 00:03:33.753
"Tell me about your powers," the squire said.

60
00:03:34.654 --> 00:03:35.374
Roxy shrugged.

61
00:03:35.394 --> 00:03:38.195
"I can fly and I have heat vision."

62
00:03:38.215 --> 00:03:42.077
"Fascinating," the squire said.

63
00:03:42.097 --> 00:03:43.898
"I'll be right back."

64
00:03:44.798 --> 00:03:46.279
He stood up and went into the kitchen.

65
00:03:46.299 --> 00:03:50.401
"I have to get back home," Roxy thought anxiously.

66
00:03:51.301 --> 00:03:54.062
She was enjoying her stay but felt worried about Wukong.

67
00:03:54.082 --> 00:03:58.004
"I hope the monkey isn't causing too much damage to Metro City."

68
00:03:59.128 --> 00:04:02.773
Suddenly her superhearing picked up a sound from somewhere else in the house.

69
00:04:03.473 --> 00:04:04.655
Roxy listened carefully.

70
00:04:04.675 --> 00:04:07.037
"Oh no," she thought.

71
00:04:07.057 --> 00:04:08.679
"Someone's crying!"
